            "en-US": "The continuation of a world where you are and a world where you aren't beside me"
          },
          {
            "id": "full-000033",
            "order": 32,
            "japanese": "愛しさも絶望も全部抱きしめた感情を、もう一度…！",
            "zh-CN": "将爱恋与绝望全部紧拥入怀的情感，再一次……！",
            "segments": [
