            "en-US": "Even my affection and my despair as well; all these feelings that I’ve embraced... once again―...!"
          },
          {
            "id": "full-000034",
            "order": 33,
            "japanese": "サヨナラも初めましても一緒に謳おうよ、未来を―！",
